esis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar C_c,\\tau_c\">\\(\\bar C_c,\\tau_c\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\">\\(\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\">\\(\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为存在唯一见证时的定描述符，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau\">\\(A&#39;\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau\\)</span> 为结构约化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_m\">\\(G_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a> 的空初始位置获胜接口；其结构参数包括扩张后全部一元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c=\\tau\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}\\}\">\\(\\tau_c=\\tau\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\tau,i}\">\\(P_{\\tau,i}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a> 规范选取的一元关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i^1\">\\(X_i^1\\)</span> 仅用于二阶量化，不作为结构解释分量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U)\\coloneqq\\iota A&#39;\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\;\\bigl(A&#39;\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land\\forall i&lt;c\\;P_{\\tau,i}^{A&#39;}=U_i\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U)\\coloneqq\\iota A&#39;\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\;\\bigl(A&#39;\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land\\forall i&lt;c\\;P_{\\tau,i}^{A&#39;}=U_i\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 8.1，印刷页125–126、扫描页140–141。Samson 必须先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上选全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 个一元关系，Delilah 才在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上回应；随后是对两扩张结构的对称 EF 游戏。因此着色阶段的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\bar U\\exists\\bar V\">\\(\\forall\\bar U\\exists\\bar V\\)</span> 不能对称化，亦不能交换顺序。每个点可以同时属于多个所选一元关系，其真值向量共有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^c\">\\(2^c\\)</span> 种。</p>\n<p>扩张的存在唯一性来自保留每个旧符号的解释并逐个指定新符号；新鲜性排除冲突。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=0\">\\(c=0\\)</span> 时两着色空间各仅含空元组，扩张为原结构，本条退化为普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 轮 EF 游戏。所有输入域非空；本条不把现有有限结构接口暗中推广到无限结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar C_c,\\tau_c$ 见 [[29-df-monadic-eso]]；$\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c$，$\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c$。$\\iota$ 为存在唯一见证时的定描述符，$A'\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau$ 为结构约化。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_m$ 与 $\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m$ 取 [[29-df-ef-game]] 的空初始位置获胜接口；其结构参数包括扩张后全部一元谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_c=\\tau\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}\\}$；$P_{\\tau,i}$ 为 [[29-df-monadic-eso]] 规范选取的一元关系符号，$X_i^1$ 仅用于二阶量化，不作为结构解释分量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar C_c,\\tau_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"A'\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"G_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_c=\\tau\\cup\\{P_{\\tau,0},\\ldots,P_{\\tau,c-1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\tau,i}","display":false},{"tex":"X_i^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U)\\coloneqq\\iota A'\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_c]\\;\\bigl(A'\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land\\forall i<c\\;P_{\\tau,i}^{A'}=U_i\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MWin}_{\\tau,c,m}(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\bar U\\in\\mathcal P(|A|)^c\\;\\exists\\bar V\\in\\mathcal P(|B|)^c\\;\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m\\bigl(\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(A,\\bar U),\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}(B,\\bar V)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\bar U\\exists\\bar V","display":false},{"tex":"2^c","display":false},{"tex":"c=0","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":2710,"backlinks":[{"id":"688a1b544d81033c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Exp}_{\\tau,c}$、$G_m$、$\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m$ 取 [[29-df-monadic-so-game]] 的相同接口；$\\mathcal P(|A|)^c$ 表示长度 $c$ 的一元关系元组空间。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]、[[29-df-monadic-so-game]]、[[29-thm-monadic-so-game]] — 一元存在二阶片段及着色游戏的单向保真"},{"id":"75c22d8e0af45459","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-98","locations":[